 "notes": "CAPP-12TB haloscope 90% CL exclusion, Fig. 4 main panel (blue curve), extracted from PDF vector paths. Panel plots the ratio |g_gamma^CAPP-12TB/g_gamma^DFSZ| vs m_a (4.508-4.591 ueV); converted to g_agamma via g_DFSZ = alpha*0.36/(pi*f_a) with f_a = 5.7 ueV*1e12 GeV / m_a, validated to <1% against the inset's dashed DFSZ line. Paper assumes rho_a = 0.45 GeV/cm^3 (100% axion DM), matching the compilation normalisation (no rescaling). Curve binned to ~110 points using per-bin median of the vector vertices (narrow low-statistics upward spikes smoothed); mode-crossing gap at 4.527 ueV (380 kHz) left without points. Abstract quotes exclusion down to ~6.2e-16 GeV^-1, consistent with extracted values.",
